<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastArmorMachineableBase">
    <defName>Apparel_HG_HeaviestHeavy</defName>
    <label>Stahl Arms Para-Aramid Tactical E.O.D 'Ogre' Suit</label>
    <description>An inelegant effort from Stahl Arms to produce personal armor capable of living up to advanced specifications, The result was a multi-layered padded cataphract for modern military conflicts. There are no obvious weak points, and rather than conventional plates, the armor makes use of dense aramid-material which gives the armor its bulky waddling gait. Beneath the protective layers, Stahl included a pressurized space suit to further satisfy demands for absolute immunity to most forms of environmental damage. An internal exoskeleton helps the user operate the heavy suit, however it does not make it any less awkward to operate.\n\nWhen the need for a next-generation heavy infantry EOD and assault bodysuit was made evident during the relative inadequate performance of heavy armors on Vekta, the 'Ogre' system was tackled by a cabal of corporate interests working under intense duress. Visari Corporation's Lsha5 helmet was especially considered to be an inspired design triumph, Using a drones sensor node and deep sea exploration helmet as baselines, Visari created a sealed, tox immune, void immune, inflammable and virtually bulletproof helmet resistant to most battlefield threats aside from potent anti tank weaponry. While Stahl Arms ultimately won the bid for the bodyarmor itself, even they acknowledged the bizarre-looking effectiveness of the final work, and modified their design with Visari Corp's in a joint venture of millitary manufacturing.</description>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <recipeMaker>
      <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedMetallicTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
      <researchPrerequisite>PoweredArmor</researchPrerequisite>
      <skillRequirements>
        <Crafting>8</Crafting>
      </skillRequirements>
      <recipeUsers Inherit="False">
        <li>HG_Foundry</li>
      </recipeUsers>
	  <displayPriority>201</displayPriority>
    </recipeMaker>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Helghast/Heavy/Heavy</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
	  <drawSize>1.3</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
	<tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
