  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastArmorMachineableBase">
    <defName>Apparel_HG_NG_Assault</defName>
    <label>Visari Next-Gen Assault Armor System</label>
    <description>When Hera visari envisioned a new dawn for the Helghan state, it demanded a revised military alongside it. In light of high casualties and war weariness, this new armor project would spare no expense in keeping frontline troops safe. Visari Corp and Stahl collaborated on the contract along with a dozen other firms for components; this set however, is largely the work of the Visari Corporation, and as such was given the honor of bearing that namesake. As far as mass production infantry armor goes, this is an excellent system, meant to withstand high caliber rounds, while still remaining light and maneuverable. A happy coincidence is that efforts to environment-proof the armor have allowed this system to keep its user alive even in the harshest possible conditions, though not over extended periods. It is said that helghan orbital marines occasionally swear by this armor, even over intentionally designed space suits.</description>
    <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
